{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walthros: Renewal is now Walthros: Renewal+! Celebrating three years since the launch of Walthros: Renewal, W:R+ adds new secrets, improved animation, and rebalanced Standard mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's time to go back to where it all began. Walthros is a world filled with floating fish, cool cats, and a long-lost past waiting to be unearthed. Bob is a part-time worker for an excavation company going through the motions and making ends meet until he accidentally comes across a buried secret that could reshape history as he knows it.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A turn-based RPG with a kind-hearted doofus trying to make tough times a little easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;A charming indie RPG with heavy JRPG influences and a unabashedly clownish sense of humor. I was not expecting to feel so many emotions and be as attached to the characters and universe as I ended up toward the end of the game. Genuinely one of the best sleeper indie hits.&quot; -Slime Hunter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Turn-based combat with over a dozen unique playable characters. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > No random battles; carefully approach or avoid monsters in the field. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Three difficulty levels with customization to accommodate a range of player abilities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore a world filled with friends and foes; hang out with buddies to strengthen your bonds and unlock new stories. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 15-20 hours of game play. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Detailed bios and bestiary to add flavor to the critters you meet. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Logs for main and side quests; never get lost or forget what you need to do next. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Soundtrack by Glock &amp; Mr8bit. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Powered by OHRRPGCE. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walthros: Renewal is a full remake/reimagining of the original Walthros released for the 20th anniversary of the release of the original DOS game. This remake takes the characters and themes of the original game and gives them a new twist, introducing a world that's both familiar and new to players who enjoyed the original game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Credits: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game by PC Harrington - Music by Glock &amp; Mr8bit\u200b\u200b - Additional promotional art by Bemmpo and Kyle Toothaker\u200b</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"d0142f34f949c427e65e1c347eb4541ff00c6133.jpg","localized_name":"Lux Aeterna","name":"Lux Aeterna","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1317270/d0142f34f949c427e65e1c347eb4541ff00c6133.jpg"},{"icon":"af6c447ae0b42e69a24a66c242e983abc8a36b4c.jpg","localized_name":"The Friend","name":"The Friend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1317270/af6c447ae0b42e69a24a66c242e983abc8a36b4c.jpg"},{"icon":"53be1ad52eb8b2f9283198d094eec76f0ba91228.jpg","localized_name":"The Wanderer","name":"The Wanderer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1317270/53be1ad52eb8b2f9283198d094eec76f0ba91228.jpg"},{"icon":"0289f2ac3cf397f947ea267efe4387a439bb1fcf.jpg","localized_name":"The Magician","name":"The Magician","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1317270/0289f2ac3cf397f947ea267efe4387a439bb1fcf.jpg"},{"icon":"1e3bcfe279a92c349f324b8ddfd935f5dcefd0a2.jpg","localized_name":"The Heroes","name":"The Heroes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1317270/1e3bcfe279a92c349f324b8ddfd935f5dcefd0a2.jpg"